@startuml
title FT-013-02 — Conversion job lifecycle

actor Student
participant "Vue client" as UI
participant "Library API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Conversion worker" as Worker
participant "Isolated renderer" as Renderer
participant "LibraryObjectStore" as Store

Student -> UI: Convert original GP
UI -> API: POST conversion-jobs
Idempotency-Key + If-Match + sourceAssetId
API -> DB: Lock owner material + source asset
API -> DB: Check owner, role, format, state, SHA, quota
API -> DB: Insert QUEUED job + request fingerprint
DB --> API: jobId, revision
API --> UI: 202 Accepted + job URL

Worker -> DB: Claim slot + QUEUED job
FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
DB --> Worker: leaseOwner, leaseUntil, source snapshot
Worker -> Store: Open source object read-only
Worker -> Renderer: Import + inspect tracks
(no network, bounded resources)
Renderer --> Worker: Track catalog

alt Several guitar tracks
  Worker -> DB: Save tracks; state AWAITING_TRACK_SELECTION
release global worker slot
  DB --> UI: Poll state + track list
  Student -> UI: Select track
  UI -> API: POST track-selection + If-Match
  API -> DB: Validate trackIndex; state QUEUED
  Worker -> DB: Claim slot + selected job
else One guitar track
  Worker -> DB: Save automatic selection; continue
end

Worker -> Renderer: Render PDF + synthesize WAV
same imported score revision
Renderer --> Worker: Temporary PDF + WAV
Worker -> Worker: Validate both outputs and sizes
Worker -> DB: Reserve actual output quota
Worker -> Store: Store both derived assets
Worker -> DB: Atomic commit both assets + SUCCEEDED
only if leaseOwner/revision still match
DB --> UI: SUCCEEDED + PDF/WAV links

opt Cancel
  Student -> UI: Cancel
  UI -> API: POST cancel
  API -> DB: CANCEL_REQUESTED
  Worker -> Renderer: Stop process; cleanup scratch
  Worker -> DB: CANCELLED; release lease/slot
end

opt Failure / timeout
  Worker -> Renderer: Kill at 60s watchdog or capture safe error code
  Worker -> Worker: Delete temp/partial output
  Worker -> DB: FAILED / UNSUPPORTED / TIMED_OUT
release lease/slot; keep original unchanged
end
@enduml
